Vendored from https://github.com/eafer/libzbitmap (MIT), by Ernesto A.
Fernandez <ernesto@corellium.com>, pinned at commit
574abeae25b25c3319b9b6a9225cc7464e08ae88.

Used to decode decmpfs compression type 14 (LZBITMAP). Apple publishes no
specification for LZBITMAP and has not open-sourced it; this implementation was
reverse-engineered by black-box testing. It is the only public one.

Files are unmodified.
